    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-prov20">
        <head xml:id="gom-prov20-Hd1e98">Caput 20</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov20-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov20-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov20-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov20_1@1-2">Luxuriosa res.</quote>
            Sequitur.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov20-Dd1e111">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov20-Hd1e113">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov20-d1e115">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e117" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov20_4@8-8">Aestate.</quote>
            Regnum Dei aestati comparatur, quia nunc moeroris nostri nubila transient, et vitae dies aeterni solis claritate fulgebunt.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov20-Dd1e122">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov20-Hd1e124">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov20-d1e126">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e128" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov20_7@7-11">Beatos post se filios relinquet.</quote>
            Non ad litteram, sed exempla ejus sequentes. Unde omnes electi, filii Abrahae quibus non praesens, sed futura <pb ed="#P" n="1103C"/> beatitudo promittitur, unde, <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e133" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov20_8@1-3">Rex qui sedit.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov20-Dd1e138">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov20-Hd1e140">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov20-d1e142">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e144" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov20_8@1-6">Rex qui sedit in solio judicii.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e147"><seg type="qs">Etsi in hac vita electi mala patiantur reproborum</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">digna factis recipit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov20-Dd1e157">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov20-Hd1e159">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov20-d1e161">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e163" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov20_9@1-3">Qui potest dicere.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e166"><seg type="qs">Non dicit, quis habet</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">proximorum quasi vilia despiciunt, subdit:</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov20-Dd1e175">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov20-Hd1e177">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov20-d1e179">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e181" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov20_10@1-3">Pondus et pondus.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e184"><seg type="qs">Diversum pondus</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quibus indiciis judicium nostri dirigere debeamus.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov20-Dd1e193">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov20-Hd1e195">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov20-d1e197">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e199" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov20_11@1-4">Ex studiis suis intelligitur.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e202"><seg type="qs">Quemcunque enim virtutibus cum modestia continentiae</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sicut e contra: <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e208" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov13_20@7-10">Amicus stultorum similis efficitur.</quote></seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov20-Dd1e213">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov20-Hd1e215">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov20-d1e217">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e219" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov20_12@6-8">Dominus fecit utrumque.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e222"><seg type="qs">Nemo ad praedicandum idoneus fratrem simplicem despiciat, <pb ed="#P" n="1103D"/></seg> etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">dans unicuique secundum mensuram donationis suae.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov20-Dd1e232">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov20-Hd1e234">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov20-d1e236">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e238" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov20_14@1-2">Malum est.</quote>
            Qui aeterna praemia in coelis praeparare desiderat, malum est, quod in praesenti debet sustinere, ut cum recesserit de mundo, glorietur, aperte prospiciens, quia <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e241" source="http://scta.info/resource/rom8_18@4-9">non sunt condignae passiones hujus temporis,</quote> etc.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov20-Dd1e246">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov20-Hd1e248">Versus 15</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov20-d1e250">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e252" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov20_15@1-4">Est aurum et multitudo.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e255"><seg type="qs">Haec est gloriatio sapientis emptoris</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et vasis esse assimilanda pretiosis.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov20-Dd1e265">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov20-Hd1e267">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov20-d1e269">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e271" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov20_17@1-5">Suavis est homini panis mendacii,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e274"><seg type="qs">In quocunque membro quis amplius peccaverit</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quae in verbis superfluis in epulando defluxerat.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov20-Dd1e283">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov20-Hd1e285">Versus 21</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov20-d1e287">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1104A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e291" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov20_21@1-1">Haereditas.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e294"><seg type="qs">Qui per avaritiae nequitiam in hac vita multiplicari appetunt</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">abominatio est apud Deum.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov20-Dd1e303">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov20-Hd1e305">Versus 23</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov20-d1e307">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e309" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov20_23@1-9">Abominatio est apud Deum pondus et pondus, statera dolosa,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e312"><seg type="qs">Duplex pondus et stateram dolosam habet in corde suo</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">vel animam suam Deo in baptismo consecratam.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov20-Dd1e321">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov20-Hd1e323">Versus 25</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov20-d1e325">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e327" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov20_25@1-9">Ruina est homini devorare sanctos, et post vota retractare.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e330"><seg type="qs">Si peccatum est cuilibet nocere</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et eos qui, ut sua vota compleant, sanctos persequuntur, damnatio manet aeterna. Ideo subdit:</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov20-Dd1e339">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov20-Hd1e341">Versus 26</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov20-d1e343">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e345" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov20_26@1-9">Dissipat impios rex sapiens, et incurvat super eos fornicem.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e348"><seg type="qs">Mos fuit antiquis</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">cui rotae est contraria <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e354" source="http://scta.info/resource/iac1_12@11-17">corona vitae quam repromittit <pb ed="#P" n="1104B"/> Deus diligentibus se.</quote></seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov20-Dd1e361">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov20-Hd1e363">Versus 30</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov20-d1e365">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e367" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov20_30@1-2">Livor vulneris.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov20-Qd1e370"><seg type="qs">Cum enim extra percutimur</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quia sicut venter escas, ita mens pertractando excoquit curas.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
